  "body": "WebIDL forbids attributes with `sequence<>` types: https://heycam.github.io/webidl/#idl-attributes. `uuids` should probably be a 0-argument function instead. WebIDL says [read-only arrays](https://heycam.github.io/webidl/#dfn-read-only-array) are possible, but I don't see how to specify that `uuids` is one, unless that has to be done in prose.\n",
